      "message": "So I was confused why the NPCX code did a gpio_reset but this code\ndidn\u0027t. It seemed safe and the right thing to ensure the GPIO is set up\ncorrectly as an input, since we were flagging it to be used as an interrupt source, and some code somewhere may have changed it.\nIf you think this is not needed, happy to leave it out.",
